Match alerts now arrive. Tap the bell on a match to choose wickets, boundaries, milestones, start and result, plus the live score card. Quiet hours and your Settings switches now apply to them.

Series pages have real Schedule and Stats tabs, and the schedule opens on the next match. The Series tab has a Past view for earlier years.

A match now links to its series, and back from there returns you to the match. Closing a match opened from a series or search no longer drops you on Home.
